{"c":[{"id":"7bdadb9eac2d17e2","sum":"fold_request quotes captions without grain or prefix; ids stay on Run: and wake. Membership: this repository, not this clone; denylist: PR opened / checks passed / task archived. Keep prompt_text and how_to_text direct; AGENTS.md lockstep; do not factor MEMBERSHIP_PROBE.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"f3167b0d6e37b6f8","sum":"fold_request quotes captions without grain or prefix; ids stay on Run: and wake. nap-ack archived PR #70 in 0.10.0; fold-pack-captions archived PR #72.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5324ef472b747f57","sum":"nap-ack archived PR #70 in 0.10.0; fold_request quotes captions without grain or prefix; ids stay on Run: and wake","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260828T203321Z-c2a6d088a4562375","text":"nap-ack archived to memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260828-nap-ack.md; PR #70 shipped in 0.10.0","type":"note"},{"name":"20260828T204506Z-31f09329ef4334ce","text":"fold_request quotes pack captions without grain or prefix; ids stay on Run: and on wake","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"615d4dde9f0c32a6","sum":"fold-pack-captions: QA PASS (captions-only pack quotes; Run ids, wake grammar, dated leaf quotes, blank missing captions); archived to memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260828-fold-pack-captions.md; PR #72 shipped","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260828T204631Z-e522d85fd7832cb5","text":"QA PASS fold-pack-captions: captions-only pack quotes; Run ids, wake grammar, dated leaf quotes, and blank missing captions verified.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260828T221517Z-3d32badb9e14e803","text":"fold-pack-captions archived to memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260828-fold-pack-captions.md; PR #72 shipped","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"875be840dc360726","sum":"Membership: work on this repository, not this clone; how-to denylist is PR opened / checks passed / task archived. Keep the short phrase direct in prompt_text and how_to_text; AGENTS.md lockstep; factoring MEMBERSHIP_PROBE is not worth it.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"6d3d53d6fdf41b4e","sum":"Membership: another contributor needs it to work on this repository, not in this clone; how-to denylist is PR opened / checks passed / task archived.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260828T224532Z-bccf1887bea608d5","text":"note membership probe is work in this clone; how-to denylist is PR opened / checks passed / task archived","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T000716Z-4f13dab49598cbb6","text":"Membership wording: say 'work on this repository', not 'work in this clone'; contributors have separate checkouts.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"24fb43f4be5c6f63","sum":"prompt_text and how_to_text keep the short membership phrase direct; AGENTS.md lockstep covers the bootstrap copy. Factoring MEMBERSHIP_PROBE harms readability for negligible benefit.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T001244Z-53dde24650751d3f","text":"prompt_text and how_to_text share MEMBERSHIP_PROBE; AGENTS.md lockstep covers the bootstrap copy.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T002301Z-2fe1954978d4b4e4","text":"Keep the short membership phrase direct in prompt_text and how_to_text; factoring it harms readability for negligible benefit.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"99582cfe7bce97c1","sum":"Write rule lives only in editable init/AGENTS.md; wake Usage is mechanics, owns its argv, and fold_request prints the exact Run: line. Prompt wording is unpinned except AGENTS.md lockstep. Leaf identity is leafset_id and leaf_digests; heal may drop a packed loose note (#77).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"6cee800557d99eac","sum":"Write rule lives only in init/AGENTS.md as editable policy; wake Usage is mechanics only. Usage owns every argv it claims; fold_request prints the exact Run: line. Prompt and write-rule wording are not pinned, only AGENTS.md lockstep and init identity; prefix teaches no argv.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"44e244aef3c74c04","sum":"Write rule lives only in init/AGENTS.md as editable policy; wake Usage is mechanics only (repeating membership would override a consumer's gate). Usage owns every argv it claims; fold_request prints the exact Run: line; Usage must not say Run:.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T164055Z-10a43354ce0f7523","text":"Creative: write rule lives only in init/AGENTS.md as editable policy; wake Usage is mechanics only; repeating membership on wake would override a consumer's gate.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T170414Z-a3069e4d545d0246","text":"Usage owns every argv it claims: note, nap ID-A ID-B CAPTION, recall, zoom, wake --path. fold_request still prints the exact Run: line; Usage must not say Run:","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"750292c631261ac3","sum":"prompt_text and write-rule wording are not pinned; only AGENTS.md prefix lockstep and init identity are. Prefix must not teach note/nap argv or Usage recipes; fold_request prints the exact Run: line; invoked as {AGENT_BIN} is not a recipe.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T204616Z-0c23f7c61b19009e","text":"prompt_text wording is not pinned; only AGENTS.md prefix lockstep and init identity. Prefix must not teach note/nap argv or Usage recipes.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T210418Z-1a2dc36f0829c667","text":"Usage does not teach nap argv; fold_request still prints the exact Run: line. Prefix may say invoked as {AGENT_BIN}; that is not a recipe. Write-rule wording is not pinned — AGENTS.md lockstep and init identity are.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4d7aff95d7826e88","sum":"Leaf identity is content: leafset_id keys the multiset, leaf_digests the set. Heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the #77 shoebox, intended. Theory names the system; the leak may name those two functions.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"921a29be1c45a6be","sum":"Leaf identity is content: leafset_id keys the multiset, leaf_digests the set. Heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the #77 shoebox. Theory names the system; the leak may name those two functions. Do not cite notes.md for that judgement.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T211122Z-ad3d3bf48d2c3470","text":"Leaf identity is content-only: heal drops a loose note whose text already sits inside a pack, silently deleting a just-written note (#77). leafset_id keys on the multiset; leaf_digests keys on the set.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T214451Z-1d8350664f6c3f7d","text":"theory.md argues why it converges: name the system, not summem:line. Architecture owns filenames and functions. Exception: the #77 leak names leafset_id vs leaf_digests because that disagreement is the defect. Do not cite notes.md from 'leaving the cut open is a judgement'.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"20725fd9d9689622","sum":"Leaf identity is content (L is a set of facts), not per-file name+bytes; heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the #77 shoebox, intended, not a bug.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T220028Z-01040c6fdd23aa89","text":"Leaf identity is per-file (name + bytes); two recordings of one sentence are two leaves (#77)","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T220314Z-0fd6a303482b711a","text":"L is a set of facts (content); heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the shoebox, not a bug. #77 trigger 1 is intended.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
